      "created_at": "2016-08-07T15:36:14.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I had a favor to ask some of you guys: I'm still on the fence wether I want to open the foil cards or not (I'm worried leaving them in a hot car like I do all my other cards wouldn't end well, and I also mainly got them for collections sake), I'm leaning more towards not though. But I want to have a binder with all the character cards in it, which is where my request comes in. When the foil cards come out, would it be possible for one of you guys to provide the order the cards come in, so I can make the binder as organized as possible? I know it's a lot of typing, and I'm okay if none of you want to (I can just wait for the promo pack if that's the case), but I would be very grateful if one of you guys did that.</p>",
